---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../site';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="para">
      I lead design and research for LinuxONE and Linux on Z at IBM. My current work
      includes product and platform strategy, client research, and the organizational
      work required to move a technical product from proposal to delivery.
    </p>
    <p class="para">
      My technical range includes Linux on Z, virtualization, containers, virtual
      machines, networking, storage, APIs, hybrid cloud patterns, and server hardware.
      I use that knowledge to evaluate product proposals, APIs, and demonstrations
      with engineering.
    </p>
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><b>Senior design and research lead, LinuxONE and Linux on Z</b><span>IBM</span></li>
      <li><b>Senior design and research manager, AIOps on Z</b><span>IBM, 2023 to 2024</span></li>
      <li><b>Senior design and research manager, z/OS hybrid cloud</b><span>IBM, 2019 to 2023</span></li>
      <li><b>UX researcher</b><span>IBM, 2017 to 2018</span></li>
      <li><b>UX designer and front-end developer</b><span>IBM, 2015 to 2019</span></li>
      <li><b>UI developer</b><span>Spiceworks</span></li>
      <li><b>B.S. in Computer Science and Human Computer Interaction</b><span>University of Rochester, 2014</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="para">Based in {site.location}. <a href={site.linkedin}>Full history on LinkedIn.</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
.about{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 40px 120px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);margin:0 0 20px}
h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin:2em 0 .6em}
.para{color:var(--type-2);max-width:62ch}
.timeline{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.timeline li{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--type-2);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.timeline b{color:var(--type);font-weight:700}
.timeline span{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
a{color:var(--accent)}
@media(max-width:640px){.about{padding:36px 24px 80px}.timeline li{display:block}.timeline span{display:block;text-align:left;margin-top:3px;white-space:normal}}
</style>
